       using only distractor colors. Ensure no distractor pixel lands inside signal bbox.
       Ensure no distractor component reaches signal area (>=3x gap required).
    6. Verify: largest 4-connected monochromatic component is uniquely the signal.
       FG density 5-16%. If violated, regenerate distractors.
    7. Input = the 30x30 grid; Output = the tight crop from step 3.
